":"b-60231c49dc295dae8cde","layer":"original","quote":"权辄为书，厚加宠赐，以答慰之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":80,"end":94},{"id":"yaoci-q-373ff8d65a36238281b4","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-ec8045d3ff0b67bf5120","layer":"pei","quote":"琬与卓相害，而壹尽心于琬，甚有声称。卓恶之，乃署教曰：‘司徒掾士壹，不得除用！’故历年不迁。会卓入关，壹乃亡归","attribution":"裴注·吴书","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-48f0b2f21db95c73dcf1","start":10,"end":65},{"id":"yaoci-q-5fa61d1aa48f459a9159","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-60231c49dc295dae8cde","layer":"original","quote":"燮每遣使诣权，致杂香、细葛〖11〗，辄以千数；明珠、大贝、流离、翡翠、玳瑁、犀、象之珍〖12〗；奇物异果，蕉、邪、龙眼之属〖13〗：无岁不至。壹时贡马凡数百匹","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":216,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79},{"id":"yaoci-q-65645e78792244c7c78d","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-4c3e132b7835e845694f","layer":"original","quote":"交州刺史朱符为夷贼所杀，州郡扰乱。燮乃表壹领合浦太守，次弟徐闻令8 领九真太守〖13〗，﹝二﹞8弟武领南海太守","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":114,"end":169},{"id":"yaoci-q-b38479d873cc0816d735","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-32a6488e833ebc5f0050","layer":"original","quote":"燮兄弟并为列郡，雄长一州；偏在万里，威尊无上。出入鸣钟、磬〖23〗，备具威仪，笳箫鼓吹，车骑满道。胡人夹毂焚烧香者，常有数十〖24〗。妻妾乘辎〖25〗，子弟从兵骑；当时贵重，震服百蛮","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":91},{"id":"yaoci-q-b8e3612b2d688abbb1f2","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-d0ec6c93df282e6a1cee","layer":"original","quote":"壹、8 、匡，后出，权原其罪〖24〗；及燮质子 ：皆免为庶人","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30},{"id":"yaoci-q-d135f7e6537de7362c0a","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-4c3e132b7835e845694f","layer":"original","quote":"刺史丁宫征还京都，壹侍送勤恪〖9〗。宫感之，临别谓曰：“刺史若待罪三事〖10〗，当相辟也。”后宫为司徒，辟壹。比至，宫已免","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":18,"end":79},{"id":"yaoci-q-e0768a41282ddeb089b2","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-4c3e132b7835e845694f","layer":"original","quote":"黄琬代为司徒〖11〗，甚礼遇壹。董卓作乱，壹亡归乡里","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":176,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":80,"end":106},{"id":"yaoci-q-e5cb5f637a69ea0d5240","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-d0ec6c93df282e6a1cee","layer":"original","quote":"数岁，壹、8 坐法诛","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":220,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":35,"end":45}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
